# Internal derivative-maker package; never uploaded to Debian, no BTS bug to close.
dist-ai: initial-upload-closes-no-bugs
# The tb-updater test library inspects the dpkg database on purpose, to assert the
# real package state the suite is validating.
dist-ai: uses-dpkg-database-directly
# Each suite ships its README / THREAT-MODEL next to its tests under
# usr/share/<suite>-tests/, documenting the directory it sits in -- the case lintian
# itself says to override. Context-less: it holds for all ~44 suites, and a per-file
# list would drift as suites are added or removed.
dist-ai: package-contains-documentation-outside-usr-share-doc
